-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components and data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

models/det.onnx
  PP-OCRv6 text detection model (tiny) from PaddleOCR, ONNX conversion distributed
  by RapidOCR. Weights stored as INT8 (weight-only quantization) by doksli-ocr.
  PaddleOCR: Copyright (c) PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache License 2.0.
    https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
  RapidOCR: Copyright (c) RapidAI. Apache License 2.0.
    https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR

models/rec.onnx, models/rec_dict.txt
  Fine-tuned from the PP-OCRv6 text recognition model (tiny) of PaddleOCR.
  The character dictionary is PaddleOCR's ppocrv6_tiny_dict.txt.
  PaddleOCR: Copyright (c) PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache License 2.0.

models/corners.onnx
  Card-corner model trained for doksli-ocr. Its backbone was initialized from the
  torchvision MobileNetV3-Small ImageNet weights (torchvision: BSD 3-Clause License,
  https://github.com/pytorch/vision).

models/wilayah.csv
  Codes and names of Indonesian administrative regions (provinsi, kabupaten/kota,
  kecamatan, kelurahan/desa) following the Ministry of Home Affairs (Kemendagri) codes.
  Compiled and owned by the doksli-ocr author; distributed under the same Apache License 2.0
  as this project.

src/parse.js (KPP list)
  Names of Indonesian tax offices (Kantor Pelayanan Pajak) from the public directory
  of the Directorate General of Taxes: https://www.pajak.go.id/daftar-unit-kerja

src/parse.js (occupation list)
  Occupation categories used on Indonesian identity cards (Dukcapil).

onnxruntime-web (peer dependency, not bundled)
